# Never bake secrets or local state into the image.
#
# The patterns MUST be recursive: .dockerignore matches against the path
# relative to the build context root, and the context here is the REPO root
# (deploy/docker-compose.yml uses `build: ..`). A bare `.env` therefore only
# excludes the top-level file and would let deploy/.env, deploy/.env.demo and
# secrets/ into an image layer, where `docker save` reveals every wallet
# mnemonic. Verified with a build-context probe; do not "simplify" these.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
secrets/

node_modules
.git

# Local databases stay out by default: db/passport.db can contain wallet sync
# state (midnight_WalletSyncStates) from live runs. Provide a prepared DB via a
# volume instead, or consciously remove these lines to bake one in
# (docs/public-demo.md explains how to sanitize it first).
db/*.db
db/*.db-journal
db/*.db-wal
db/*.db-shm

# Regenerated by postinstall inside the image.
@cds-models
app/connector/dist

# Not needed at runtime.
test/screenshots
docs
*.tgz
